## Automatic Post-Implementation Review

If `auto_review_on_change: true` is set in `.agents/project-context.md` (or requested by the user):
- After you edit or generate code in response to any prompt, automatically inspect the git diff before completing.
- Verify correctness, security, and project standards.
- Append a concise P0–P3 Self-Review checklist to your response.
